      "note": "Opel Insignia owner's manual (EN, edition 2011, manualslib 936387): \"International service schedule\", printed pp. 193-196 (site pages 193-196), five columns of 15,000 km / 1 year; additional operations p. 197. Insignia lists A16XER/A18XER/A16LET/A20NHT/A28NET and diesels."
