      "url": "https://public-servicebox.opel.com/OVddb/OV/he_IL/Astra_J/2010_2016/2013/manual_user/om_astra_kta-2685_6-heb_eu_my13_ed0812_18_he_il_online%5Bastra%5D.pdf",
